{
  "description": "Urban land-use model engine — Burgess concentric, Hoyt sector, and Harris-Ullman multiple-nuclei overlays toggle on a config-declared city map; the learner cycles each zone's land-use tag and checks how many zones match the selected model's prediction, on a math-canvas. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
